1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,430
Sao. Sah. Assa. Odou. These are all names of the safou.

2
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:11,804
Every language in Cameroon has its own. Duala, Bassa, Ewondo, Fang, Bamum...

3
00:00:12,051 --> 00:00:14,052
But who recorded them, and where?

4
00:00:14,368 --> 00:00:16,880
AfroAtlas brings these names together, with sources.

5
00:00:17,205 --> 00:00:21,470
For every product: its names, its language, and the book that attests it.

6
00:00:21,779 --> 00:00:24,495
Eight regions of Cameroon already documented.

7
00:00:24,802 --> 00:00:26,832
At the market, show the card to the seller.

8
00:00:27,158 --> 00:00:29,119
And already, thirteen African countries.

